   - Inductive result constructors WhiteWins, BlackWins, Draw
   - WhiteStrategy : Type, BlackStrategy : Type (inhabited legal policies)
   - play : WhiteStrategy -> BlackStrategy -> GameTrace
   - outcome : GameTrace -> Result

   Specify: 125 distinguishable positions, 109 correct 5-point lines,
